# Tests & Verify

## 回归（大改后必跑）

```bash
npm run test:regression
npm run build   # 动 src/
```

串联 14 组：`test:fund-estimate`、`test:realtime-profit`、`test:display-session`、`test:display-state`、`test:live-pipeline`、`test:realtime-display-pipeline`、`test:phase-transition`、`test:timeline-audit`、`test:fund-holding-fields`、`test:fund-regular-eligibility`、`test:holdings-rt1`、`test:scope-totals`、`test:holding-market`、`test:market-session`。

**Agent 完成 RT1/EST/snap/穿透相关任务前必须执行 `test:regression` 并确认全绿。**

